==Strategy==
The easiest method is to rush this stage and destroy the enemy base before Kory spawns.

If you cannot do this, then you should prioritise the use of tankers like [[Curling Cat (Rare Cat)|Cleanerbot Cat]] because of the allied units limit. Avoid low health cats without Wave Immunity, or alternatively use a Wave Blocker like [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]]. Bring an attacker like courier cat to deal with the peons, and backliner like [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]] or [[Red Riding Mina (Special Cat)|Crimson Mina]] to deal with the Kory. Bring a meatshield like crazed wall cat to fill in the gaps where your tanker is still reaching the front line.

If you have [[Awakened Bahamut Cat]] then these stages should be very easy, save up cash at the start and then send out him, this should lead to a quick victory, especially if you have other units (such as [[Crazed Giraffe Cat]] or even [[Holy Valkyrie Cat]]).

